WEBVTT

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.960
Happy New Year!

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.500
Pri!

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.530
Usa!

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.820
Go! Happy New Year!

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.200
Let's have a great year!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:20.910
Pri!

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:21.790
Usa!

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.670
Gashunk!

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.630
I love Hawaii!

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:26.900
Hibernating

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.460
Happy New Year-kuma.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.090
Hibernating

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.460
Happy New Year, everyone!

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:13.900
Happy New Year!

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:17.370
I hope you'll enjoy <i>me</i> this coming year.

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:22.090
And, I have an important announcement for the year.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.080
And it is...

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:25.240
Paradise Prize Contest!

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.300
Tada-da, tada-dadah!

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:32.130
The date of our last Paradise Prize Contest has been decided!

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:37.760
And that final ParaPri is...

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.900
Lovely, Meganii!

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.500
Prince Meganii!

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:47.640
I'm afraid I'm still rather tipsy from last night.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.440
It's one month from now!

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.230
In a month!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:03:02.160
The team to win this Last ParaPri will finally obtain the entirety of the Paradise Coord!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.990
<i>All in!</i>

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.370
Do your best, my lovelies.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:13.960
So you may show the delighted,
enraptured looks on your faces to <i>me</i>.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.130
To me, and me alone.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:19.650
I love you Meganii!

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:21.340
Marry me!

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.430
I hope you were listening-kuma!

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.770
This is our last chance for the entire year!

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:27.740
Mr. Kuma!

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.480
Weren't you hibernating-pri?

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:34.400
You say some awful strange things sometimes-kuma. Hibernation is for bears-kuma.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:38.090
We'll beat that Falulu next time-kuma!

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:43.530
Starting today, every day will have 24 hours, 1,440 minutes, 86,400 seconds of practice time!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.840
Practice! Practice!

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.790
Then practice more!

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:49.980
Of course!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.040
We'll do just that.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.040
Ca... Cah-choo!

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:00.570
That fever's not going down, is it?

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:06.100
I'll come see how you are later. Sleep tight.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.760
Sure...

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:16.670
Most of those who become Divine Idols have won the Paradise Coord.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:23.650
In other words, it might be accurate to call it one of the gateways to becoming a Divine Idol.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:28.020
And the Paradise Coord has a particular legend about it.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:30.430
It's that they're meant to "shine".

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.680
But they've never been seen actually shining.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:37.030
Can they really shine?

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:40.510
Is there a secret to making them shine?

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:44.800
And might they begin to shine at this year's ParaPri?

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.320
I wonder how you make them shine.

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:54.120
I wish we could make them glow.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:56.230
Cold!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:59.150
What are you on about? You haven't even won them.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.840
You've got a lot of practice ahead.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:05.410
How else are you gonna catch up to Lady Falulu?

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.620
Lady Falulu...

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:12.220
<i>Lady Falulu's</i> already qualified for the next one, too.

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:15.720
You'll have to work way harder.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:19.930
Gotta work harder so I don't lose to Lady Falulu...

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.860
Hey, Non! <i>Lady?</i> What's with the <i>Lady?</i>

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:26.250
Non became a Falulu fan?

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:28.680
Capisce.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:32.360
She used to be a Pink Actress fan...

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:36.310
Falulu is on fire.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.650
Besides, Non...

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.600
Why aren't you a SoLaMi Smile fan?

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.990
Capisce!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.790
We're the Falulu Royal Guard!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.250
You ripped off her "Capisce"!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.830
Eh? What?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:03.180
Lady Falulu is super popular, but that's no excuse to steal her "Capisce"!

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:06.090
Never try to use "Capisce" again!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.980
Capisce is my thing!

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:10.050
Shut up!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:18.440
Capisce! Capisce! Capisce!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:22.050
Capisce...

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.110
Hello!

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.820
Here we come!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.520
Welcome!

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:33.230
You're warmly welcomessina!

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:35.310
So, we heard Lala had gotten a cold...

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:39.530
Minami! Houjou! Welcome!

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:41.000
Headmistress?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:46.840
Papa's Pasta is very busy today, so I came to help! <i>Gracie!</i>

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.860
I... I see.
Gracie, gracie!

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:51.040
You really saved us, Glo!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:53.230
Oh, Hime!

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:54.550
Glo!

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.330
We're friends!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:02.150
Ookanda's starting the New Year with a bang.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.570
She sure has changed a lot.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.030
Non, here's a New Year's gift.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:10.960
New Year's Red Flash!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.640
Thank you.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:16.430
Lala? Coming in.

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:23.060
P-Perform... Gotta perform...

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:28.760
Beat Falulu... Get the Paradise Coord...

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.970
What you need is rest.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:37.560
But Falulu's gonna steal my Capisce!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:41.830
<i>Your </i>"Capisce"? Isn't that Lady Falulu's gimmick?

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:42.810
Non!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.060
Just kidding!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:47.980
How would she even begin to steal that?

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.720
Minami? Sophie?

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:54.610
They came to visit you. Call me if you need anything.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.350
Non's keeping it togehter.

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.080
And how are you feeling?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.830
Red Flash for colds. Works every time.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.550
And a law book! For when you get bored.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.550
Th-Thanks.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:13.530
Oh! You haven't done any of your homework, have you?

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:14.300
Gulp!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:21.270
Paprika Private Academy Rule 31: Students must finish vacation homework with time to spare!

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.100
Ehh?

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:27.870
Is what I'd like to say, but since you have a cold, I'll let it slide.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.820
Th-Thanks.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:33.280
The perfect pillow!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.370
Right this way.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:39.650
Happy New Year!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:44.080
I sought to challenge Minami to a game of go and was told she'd be here.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.890
Dressing Pafé!

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:47.420
You caught a cold?

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.460
You've been sweating a lot.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.260
I'll wipe you off.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.220
Oh, thanks.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.940
You're so gentle, Leona.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:59.740
As would befit my little brother.

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:02.630
Right you are. What a good brother—

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:03.600
Brother!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.940
Hold it right there!

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:06.860
Leave it at that, Leona!

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:08.770
We'll take care of that!

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:11.730
Pshu...

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.660
About to steal "Capisce"?

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:16.320
Yeah, that's what my dream was about.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:20.990
Well, how about you spice it up some?

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.040
Spice?

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:25.300
Caspicy! Caspinach!

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.240
You what?

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.450
Maxpisce!

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:28.800
Relax!

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:30.600
You can have those.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.270
For what?

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:33.340
Come on in.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:36.220
Yoohoo! Doing good, Lala?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.430
Guess not. Get well soon!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.880
Nao! You came!

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.180
I'm not alone.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.610
W-Walkover!

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.940
That's having retired from a sporting event.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.770
Eiko and Love!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:55.110
Get well soon, and get on stage!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:57.940
All right everyone, eat up!

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:01.660
Here you gorgonzola! On the houseñorita!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.020
Love - All!

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.710
Hey, don't push!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:07.110
Love's loving it!

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.150
So good!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:15.590
Good grief... No way can she sleep like this.

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.780
All better!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:41.450
Capisce! Capisce! Capisce! Capisce!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.490
Thanks, Non!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.790
I'm all better thanks to you!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:52.830
Non's got it too? From me?

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.460
It's fine. Nothing surprising.

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.720
Next up is Dad.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:58.470
And then you...

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:00.260
Right.

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.390
Non...

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:11.600
<i>Oh yeah! I bet she'd be happy if I got her Falulu's autograph.</i>

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.630
<i>That might help her get better!</i>

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:17.830
Just you wait, Non!

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.960
Eh? Non's got it now?

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:34.920
Yeah. I'm here to get something to heal her.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.160
Falulu's autograph?

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:39.510
You... Falulu's the enemy-kuma!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:42.970
But we have to do it if it helps Non out-pri.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:46.290
Right-kuma! Sir Kuma is always an ally to the children-kuma.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.520
Let's go! To Falulu!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.980
So, Falulu lives...

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:51.790
Where?

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:52.600
Uh...

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.690
Huh?

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:58.540
We can't find Falulu!

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.590
We went through all the dressing rooms-pri!

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:03.240
Where could she be hiding-kuma?

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:06.430
We have located Falulu-chanko!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:11.790
Chanko! Falulu has a special suite here-chanko!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:16.180
She has a whole high-class floor reserved at the PriPara TV building.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.970
What a crowd.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.220
That's her suite!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.510
Th-The arrogance!

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.630
Lady Falulu!

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:32.100
Falulu!

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:34.330
So many fans already-chanko.

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:36.520
No special treatment-kuma!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:40.180
I'll give a stern talking to that Falulu and Unicorn-kuma!

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:42.160
Stern talking about what?

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.860
Oh, Almighty Unicorn.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.850
Lovely day, is it not? And you look stunning!

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:49.600
Lost his nerve instantly.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:53.080
Hey, Unicorn, we'd like to see Falulu.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.410
We have no time to waste on you lot.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:59.040
Turn tail and run off.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.800
Well, my sister caught a cold and...

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.150
A cold?!

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:06.160
Don't they say idiots can't catch colds? How peculiar.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:10.260
Even I got one! Non is smart so of course she'd get it!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:12.020
Lady Falulu!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.120
Falulu!

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.190
Falulu!

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.610
What? Us?

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:29.510
Tch, guess you have a moment.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:38.830
So cute! Lovely!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.760
I have lots of fans.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:43.000
I'm happy.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.210
Yeah! You're amazing, Falulu!

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:49.300
So? What do you want? Take care of business and get out.

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:52.330
Falulu, can I have an autograph?

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.620
Autograph?

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:58.180
My little sister caught a cold, and since she's your fan, I thought she'd like that.

00:13:58.180 --> 00:13:59.520
Autograph?

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.620
Capisce.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.920
Ah! Capisce is my thing, just so you know!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.890
You can't have that!

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:08.270
Capisce! Capisce! Capisce!

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.200
Gah! What-pri!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:11.700
Pri...

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.370
Eh?

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:17.920
Pop step gotcha! Falulu-pri!

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.590
Sh-She...

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:21.130
She's imitating you-chanko.

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:24.210
Imitating you-chanko.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.900
Chanko! Stop imitating me-chanko!

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.680
Stop imitating me-chanko.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:32.180
Capisce? Pri? Pshu.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:32.990
Chanko!

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.260
Kyupikon.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.270
Glo!

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.390
Capisce!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.620
She's imitating everyone-pri?

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:40.440
Capisce is mine!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.240
Pripripripripripripri...

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:44.010
Pshuuuu...

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:46.270
Chanko! Chanko chanko chanko chanko!

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:48.280
There!

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:49.840
Thanks, Falulu!

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:53.870
I taught her how to write that. I'm great like that.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.790
Oh yeah! Let's snap tickets!

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:03.160
Falulu's a Vocal Doll! She doesn't do that!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.330
If that was all, get out!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:10.470
Well then, Almighty Unicorn, we'll be off-kuma.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.140
Prism Voice...

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:13.140
Eh?

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.320
I'm glad I got it.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.310
So, I asked before too, but...

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.360
Hmm?

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.440
What exactly is a Prism Voice?

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:30.720
Prism Voice. A legendary singing voice-gel.

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.750
Didn't I say that before-kuma?

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.740
Don't you have something more concrete?

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:38.700
Concrete-kuma? Well, basically

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:42.330
it's a voice that calms you down,
gives you a warm feeling in your heart,

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:47.200
cheers you up, reaches the deep in your heart-kuma.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:49.550
And I have that?

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:54.010
Right-kuma. Those with Prism Voices appear on occasion.

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.390
It's quite a valuable talent.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:16:01.440
Really-pri? I'm glad we have someone like that on our team-pri!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:06.790
But in Lala's case her Prism Voice isn't always on the surface-kuma.

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.980
It's a bit like a lottery.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:13.320
If you could learn to bring it out whenever, that'd be great-kuma, but...

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.580
But we shouldn't rely on that hope too much.

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:20.340
But that makes me a bit happy. Prism Voice!

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:23.290
Oh, Mr. Kuma. Another question.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.430
What's a Vocal Doll?

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:28.310
A Vocal Doll is...

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:29.760
Is?

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.760
I don't know either-kuma!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.340
Thanks, Lala!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.010
This will heal me right up!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:39.430
I'm glad you like it.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:44.480
Don't you need to go back to PriPara, though? You won't make it to the New Year show.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.060
It's fine. I'm taking the day off.

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.020
You can't!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.530
Go perform!

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:52.360
Huh? But I should be here with you...

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:57.490
You won't ever beat Lady Falulu if you don't work at getting your rank up!

00:16:57.490 --> 00:17:00.780
Non? Aren't you Falulu's fan?

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:04.260
I am, but this and that go in different stomachs.

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:07.020
You can have cutlets and still have room for cake!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:12.050
I wanna see you at the top of PriPara.

